BAUX neovim wrapper with intelligent fallback support.

BVI provides a unified editing experience that automatically detects and
configures the best available editor:

- Neovim (preferred) with LazyVim and BAUX keymaps
- Vim with basic BAUX configuration
- Vi as final fallback

Features:
- Automatic editor detection
- BAUX keymap integration
- Session persistence
- Gruvbox theming

